    {"id":"KR-RET-NTBA-01","group":"tax_books","statute":"국세기본법","article":"85-3","paragraph":"2","citationId":"NTBA:85-3(2)","recordType":{"ko":"세법에 따른 장부 및 증거서류(예: 급여 지급·원천징수 관련 장부와 증빙)","en":"Books and supporting documents under tax laws (e.g. payroll and withholding records)"},"period":{"ko":"5년(역외거래는 7년)","years":5,"offshoreYears":7},"startsFrom":{"ko":"그 거래사실이 속하는 과세기간에 대한 해당 국세의 법정신고기한이 지난 날","basis":"85-3(2)"},"appliesIf":"internal_hr | b2c_commerce","verifiedBy":[{"url":"https://www.law.go.kr/DRF/lawService.do?target=law&type=XML&MST=288571","fetched":"2026-09-30","version":"법률 제21860호, 시행 2026-08-11"}],"caveat":"Art. 85-3(2) proviso: cases under Art. 26-2(3) keep until the date set there. Mapping payroll/withholding records to 'books and supporting documents' is an interpretation; legal review confirms which HR records fall under it. 소득세법 itself was not read."},
